  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.875,
      "end": 4.575,
      "text": "You can move quickly and still lose track of what your team actually agreed to"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.575,
      "end": 5.35,
      "text": "build."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.97,
      "end": 8.9825,
      "text": "A requirement sits in a document."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.9825,
      "end": 10.995,
      "text": "A new request arrives later."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.995,
      "end": 14.77,
      "text": "By the time work reaches a coding agent, those two things can look like the same"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.77,
      "end": 15.595,
      "text": "plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.19,
      "end": 20.465,
      "text": "Orchestra keeps those different kinds of context connected."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.06,
      "end": 24.7725,
      "text": "We're using Northstar, a fictional launch project."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.7725,
      "end": 27.0475,
      "text": "Start in Memory with the original PRD."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.0475,
      "end": 30.71,
      "text": "Its CSV export lists four fields: item ID,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.71,
      "end": 32.635,
      "text": "title, owner and status."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.635,
      "end": 35.085,
      "text": "The source stays available to inspect."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.705,
      "end": 40.93,
      "text": "Now ask Socrates: what is in scope, is PDF export approved,"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.93,
      "end": 43.105,
      "text": "and do we have a launch date or budget?"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.7,
      "end": 49.025,
      "text": "With OpenAI configured, Socrates generates an answer from the available"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.025,
      "end": 50.4125,
      "text": "project evidence."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.4125,
      "end": 53.45,
      "text": "Open a citation and check the underlying document."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.45,
      "end": 55.85,
      "text": "The useful result is not just a summary."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.85,
      "end": 57.875,
      "text": "It's a distinction you can verify."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.52,
      "end": 62.3575,
      "text": "CSV export is documented in the PRD."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.3575,
      "end": 66.695,
      "text": "PDF export appears as a later request, with no recorded approval"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.695,
      "end": 68.57,
      "text": "established by this evidence."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.57,
      "end": 72.395,
      "text": "The available sources do not establish a launch date or budget."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.99,
      "end": 76.69,
      "text": "That gives your team a more useful next question:"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.69,
      "end": 79.515,
      "text": "should PDF export become part of this launch,"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.515,
      "end": 80.99,
      "text": "and who needs to decide?"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.61,
      "end": 85.0725,
      "text": "Some questions need more than a chat response."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.0725,
      "end": 88.21,
      "text": "Deep Research takes a broader question and produces a report linked to its"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.21,
      "end": 89.0975,
      "text": "sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.0975,
      "end": 93.735,
      "text": "Here, the saved report covers CSV scope and the PDF request,"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.735,
      "end": 96.6225,
      "text": "while keeping the missing launch date and budget visible."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.6225,
      "end": 100.06,
      "text": "Open its source links to inspect the evidence behind the findings."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.06,
      "end": 102.81,
      "text": "Saving the report preserves generated evidence;"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.81,
      "end": 105.16,
      "text": "it does not create an approved requirement."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.805,
      "end": 111.5425,
      "text": "Now open Truth Inbox, where proposed changes and review signals come together."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.5425,
      "end": 115.4425,
      "text": "A reviewer can inspect the evidence and affected areas before deciding."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.4425,
      "end": 118.7675,
      "text": "In this project, PDF remains a request."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.7675,
      "end": 122.43,
      "text": "Review separates a new idea from an accepted product decision."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.025,
      "end": 128.0625,
      "text": "Before an agent starts implementation, Agent Preflight assembles a scoped pack"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.0625,
      "end": 132.8125,
      "text": "with project evidence, constraints, an acceptance checklist and open questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.8125,
      "end": 134.225,
      "text": "This pack is blocked."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.225,
      "end": 137.9125,
      "text": "The missing tests are visible, and the project has no recorded human-approved"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.9125,
      "end": 138.9875,
      "text": "requirements."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.9875,
      "end": 142.725,
      "text": "That's useful context: the next action is to resolve the gap,"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.725,
      "end": 144.5,
      "text": "not assume the work is ready."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.095,
      "end": 147.7075,
      "text": "The handoff is specific."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.7075,
      "end": 152.47,
      "text": "Pair Codex or VS Code, and use Orchestra MCP to retrieve the exact"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.47,
      "end": 154.045,
      "text": "project and pack ID."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.045,
      "end": 156.895,
      "text": "A retrieved pack is still subject to its blockers."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.895,
      "end": 160.145,
      "text": "It is context for the agent, not permission to proceed."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.765,
      "end": 164.64,
      "text": "Orchestra helps a fast-moving team keep its questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 164.64,
      "end": 166.9775,
      "text": "decisions and implementation connected."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.9775,
      "end": 168.215,
      "text": "Start with the source."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.215,
      "end": 169.5525,
      "text": "Review the change."
    },
    {
      "start": 169.5525,
      "end": 172.165,
      "text": "Give your agents context the team can trace."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.76,
      "end": 174.36,
      "text": "Orchestra."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.36,
      "end": 176.51,
      "text": "Product Brain for High Speed Teams."
    }
  ],
